@api = https://tekora.example.test/api/v1
@reservation = 42
@version = 1

### Contexto y vencimiento calculados por el servidor
GET {{api}}/reservations/{{reservation}}/checkout-context
Authorization: Bearer {{mobile_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Estado persistido
GET {{api}}/reservations/{{reservation}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{mobile_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Selección con tarjeta ficticia
POST {{api}}/reservations/{{reservation}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{mobile_token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "card",
  "instrument": "tekora-test-card",
  "idempotency_key": "b7f2976e-e74a-43b7-936e-9b43dd090421"
}

### Alternativa de efectivo (usar otra reserva o ejecutar antes de la selección de tarjeta)
POST {{api}}/reservations/{{reservation}}/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{mobile_token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "method": "cash",
  "idempotency_key": "59b8172e-dbe2-4103-8e4a-eda71d08c34b"
}

### Confirmación explícita de la reserva tras la selección válida
PATCH {{api}}/reservations/{{reservation}}/commit
Authorization: Bearer {{mobile_token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": {{version}},
  "idempotency_key": "fc91ce2d-3d01-4a5f-8db6-bffe01f071ee"
}
